WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.620
[Music] Hello I'm Rosemary Knight, a&nbsp;
Professor in the Geophysics Department&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:08.640
at Stanford. Letting you know about&nbsp;
a new online course now available,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:14.280
Harnessing the Power of Geophysical Imaging&nbsp;
to Recharge California's Groundwater.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:19.800
This course accompanies the web-based&nbsp;
app we have created, Fastpath,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:26.040
that allows you to work with geophysical data,&nbsp;
your data, or publicly available data to evaluate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:31.860
potential sites for recharge. Specifically&nbsp;
looking for fast paths from the ground surface&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:38.820
to the water table. Thus the name of our app,&nbsp;
Fastpath. So join us and harness the power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.820 --> 00:00:44.700
of geophysical imaging to support the planning&nbsp;
and implementation of managed aquifer recharge&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:52.320
throughout California. It's the way forward&nbsp;
for sustainable groundwater management [Music].

